{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 83-1. Dassanenapahātabbaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27696.532669086784\">7:41:36</span> 1. Nadassanena pahātabbaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27710.498924729633\">7:41:50</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27721.692016213623\">7:42:01</span> 2. Dassanena pahātabbaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27732.01624392323\">7:42:12</span> Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27737.495646746323\">7:42:17</span> 3. Dassanena pahātabbaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbo akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate khandhe paṭicca vicikicchāsahagato moho. (1) ^7-48a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27754.613696866487\">7:42:34</span> Nadassanena pahātabbaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27766.259261983312\">7:42:46</span> 4. Nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte dve…pe… nakamme dve, navipāke dve, navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-48a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27783.342413869825\">7:43:03</span> 5. Dassanena pahātabbo akusalo dhammo dassanena pahātabbassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-48a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27796.83897282643\">7:43:16</span> Nadassanena pahātabbo akusalo dhammo nadassanena pahātabbassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27808.065790206947\">7:43:28</span> 6. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe tīṇi (dassane ekaṃ, nadassane dve), adhipatiyā tīṇi (dassanena pahātabbamūlakaṃ ekaṃ, nadassane dve, ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati, ekārammaṇādhipati), anantare dve (dassanamūlakaṃ ekaṃ, nadassane ekaṃ), samanantare dve, sahajāte dve…pe… upanissaye tīṇi, āsevane dve, kamme dve, āhāre dve…pe… sampayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27848.433388959947\">7:44:08</span> 7. Nadassanena pahātabbaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27860.557776133515\">7:44:20</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27865.97333287316\">7:44:25</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 84-1. Bhāvanāyapahātabbaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27870.678603793054\">7:44:30</span> 8. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48c-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27885.10827181308\">7:44:45</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27890.583638816417\">7:44:50</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27895.540738926567\">7:44:55</span> 9. Bhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca bhāvanāya pahātabbo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48c-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27906.208716929905\">7:45:06</span> Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Dassanena pahātabbadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27920.34920617023\">7:45:20</span> 10. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48c-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27935.609705973297\">7:45:35</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27941.099178\">7:45:41</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 85-1. Dassanenapahātabbahetukaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27945.84642713018\">7:45:45</span> 11. Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ kusalaṃ dhamma paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbahetuko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48e-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27958.26295598331\">7:45:58</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27963.722398746322\">7:46:03</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27968.76341518692\">7:46:08</span> 12. Dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-48e-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27980.512624260355\">7:46:20</span> Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (2)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28004.788176963284\">7:46:44</span> Dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalañca nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28020.95928711015\">7:47:00</span> Dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā… tīṇi (nadassane dve, ghaṭane ekaṃ, saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28037.77442628038\">7:47:17</span> 13. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe cha, adhipatiyā dve (sabbattha cha), avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48e-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28045.044423849795\">7:47:25</span> 14. Dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. ^7-48e-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28057.44903329707\">7:47:37</span> Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28070.13530391989\">7:47:50</span> 15. Nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā cha…pe… nakamme cattāri, navipāke cha, navippayutte cha (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo). ^7-48e-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28084.43580512684\">7:48:04</span> 16. Dassanena pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo dassanena pahātabbahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48e-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28101.130583976636\">7:48:21</span> 17. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā tīṇi (dassane ekaṃ, nadassane dve), anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte cha…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme cattāri, āhāre cattāri, indriye cattāri…pe… sampayutte cha, atthiyā cha, natthiyā nava…pe… avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48e-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28132.49084385981\">7:48:52</span> 18. Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48e-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28139.25507408011\">7:48:59</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28144.315512893187\">7:49:04</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 86-1. Bhāvanāyapahātabbahetukaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28149.81668581308\">7:49:09</span> 19. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48g-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28161.900287196935\">7:49:21</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28167.122804963285\">7:49:27</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28172.711766193595\">7:49:32</span> 20. Bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca bhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-48g-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28184.30339407677\">7:49:44</span> Nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28197.21651395804\">7:49:57</span> 21. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe cha, adhipatiyā dve…pe… avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ. Dassanena pahātabbahetukadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-48g-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28210.59328310071\">7:50:10</span> 22. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48g-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28226.419936154496\">7:50:26</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28231.61686685323\">7:50:31</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 87-1. Savitakkaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28236.756837043773\">7:50:36</span> 23. Savitakkaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Savitakkaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Savitakkaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko kusalo ca avitakko kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-48i-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28264.139052734783\">7:51:04</span> Avitakkaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Avitakkaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (2)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28278.566880007726\">7:51:18</span> Savitakkaṃ kusalañca avitakkaṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28288.426696000002\">7:51:28</span> 24. Hetuyā cha, ārammaṇe cha (sabbattha cha), avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48i-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28295.99870403347\">7:51:35</span> Naadhipatiyā cha, napurejāte cha…pe… nakamme cattāri…pe… navippayutte cha (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-48j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28308.223319953653\">7:51:48</span> 25. Savitakko kusalo dhammo savitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Savitakko kusalo dhammo avitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Savitakko kusalo dhammo savitakkassa kusalassa ca avitakkassa kusalassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-48j-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28340.129002038622\">7:52:20</span> Avitakko kusalo dhammo avitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28346.788886007726\">7:52:26</span> Savitakko kusalo dhammo savitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28356.115686012876\">7:52:36</span> Avitakko kusalo dhammo avitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28365.306154837777\">7:52:45</span> Savitakko kusalo ca avitakko kusalo ca dhammā savitakkassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28376.050086951076\">7:52:56</span> 26. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (heṭṭhā tīsu sahajātādhipati, avitakke ekaṃ, sahajātādhipati), anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte cha…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme cattāri, āhāre cattāri, indriye cattāri, jhāne cha, magge cha, sampayutte cha, atthiyā cha, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate cha (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48j-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28407.91146888413\">7:53:27</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28412.45159289958\">7:53:32</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28416.628883817182\">7:53:36</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28420.505915948503\">7:53:40</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Akusalapadaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28426.141954845505\">7:53:46</span> 27. Savitakkaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Savitakkaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Savitakkaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko akusalo ca avitakko akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-48j-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28454.878269123597\">7:54:14</span> Avitakkaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28462.266972961374\">7:54:22</span> Savitakkaṃ akusalañca avitakkaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28472.546373198267\">7:54:32</span> 28. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca (sabbattha pañca)…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48j-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28479.76395411587\">7:54:39</span> 29. Savitakkaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-48j-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28487.63735303605\">7: