70</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 94-1. Rūpāvacaraduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-48w-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-48x-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29465.255712809456\">8:11:05</span> 71. Rūpāvacaraṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca rūpāvacaro kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-48x-71</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29477.007961809453\">8:11:17</span> Narūpāvacaraṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca narūpāvacaro kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29486.048244871254\">8:11:26</span> 72. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve (sabbattha dve, saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48x-72</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29490.279709018025\">8:11:30</span> Naadhipatiyā dve…pe… napurejāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ…pe… navippayutte ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29503.157097195693\">8:11:43</span> 73. Rūpāvacaro kusalo dhammo rūpāvacarassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-48x-73</p><p><br /></p><p>Narūpāvacaro kusalo dhammo narūpāvacarassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29513.974194113296\">8:11:53</span> 74. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe cattāri, adhipatiyā tīṇi (rūpāvacare ekaṃ, sahajātādhipatiyeva, narūpāvacare dve), anantare tīṇi (rūpāvacare ekaṃ, narūpāvacare dve), samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte dve…pe… upanissaye cattāri, āsevane tīṇi, kamme dve…pe… atthiyā dve, natthiyā tīṇi…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48x-74</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29543.16880321887\">8:12:23</span> 75. Narūpāvacaraṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca narūpāvacaro akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-48x-75</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29554.205797963954\">8:12:34</span> Rūpāva