ttaṃ). ^7-48-106</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30174.42156403605\">8:22:54</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30184.368236110724\">8:23:04</span> 107. Araṇaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48-107</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30192.642492889277\">8:23:12</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30202.62152530384\">8:23:22</span> 108. Araṇo abyākato dhammo araṇassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-48-108</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30210.81488071161\">8:23:30</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30215.67836416222\">8:23:35</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Piṭṭhidukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":30222.014387}